    "id" : "4c89af78",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "A minimal, self-contained register of people: any signed-in user creates, browses, edits and deletes a person's basic contact details (first name, last name, email, date of birth). No relationships, no lifecycle, no process — the platform's standard bean surfaces carry every journey."
