      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "nullable: true",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "; the save path enforces uniqueness across the register and a person without an email is allowed. The migration backs it with a unique constraint on "
