      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "email",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " — multiple NULLs are permitted, so the constraint and the \"unique when present\" rule agree. No validator code is needed: the rule rides the descriptor."
